,"annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-012-wudi:m008-0004","start":4,"end":7,"surface":"李少君","kind":"person","person_id":"87n_vk2_1ig","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-012-wudi:m008-0010","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"天子","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-012-wudi:m008-0025","start":25,"end":27,"surface":"寬舒","kind":"person","person_id":"j0a_7ai_tbu","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-012-wudi:m008-0034","start":34,"end":37,"surface":"安期生","kind":"person","person_id":"91s_bsz_pe8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-012-wudi:m008-0044","start":44,"end":51,"surface":"燕齊怪迂之方士","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"學說合稱、群體、匿名者或未定指代；不補未見姓名及成員。"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-012-wudi","book_id":"b-shiji-012","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-012-wudi"},{"id":"c-shiji-012-wudi:p016","text":"其明年冬，天子郊雍，議曰：「今上帝朕親郊，而后土毋祀，則禮不答也。」有司與太史公、祠官寬舒等議：「天地牲角繭栗。今陛下親祀后土，后土宜於澤中圜丘為五壇，壇一黃犢太牢具，已祠盡瘞，而從祠衣上黃。」於是天子遂東，始立后土祠汾陰脽上，如寬舒等議。上親望拜，如上帝禮。禮畢，天子遂至滎陽而還。過雒陽，下詔曰：「三代邈絕，遠矣難存。其以三十里地封周後為周子南君，以奉先王祀焉。」是歲，天子始巡郡縣，侵尋於泰山矣。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-012-wudi:m016-0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"天子","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-012-wudi:m016-0015","start":15,"end":17,"surface":"上帝","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"神祇、群體、匿名者或未定指代，保留來源，不補未見姓名與成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-012-wudi:m016-0022","start":22,"end":24,"surface":"后土","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"神祇、群體、匿名者或未定指代，保留來源，不補未見姓名與成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-012-wudi:m016-0037","start":37,"end":40,"surface":"太史公","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"神祇、群體、匿名者或未定指代，保留來源，不補未見姓名與成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-012-wudi:m016-0043","sta