洎之。祭日以牛，祭月以羊彘特。泰一祝宰則衣紫及繡。五帝各如其色，日赤，月白。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-012-wudi:m022-0021","start":21,"end":23,"surface":"寬舒","kind":"person","person_id":"j0a_7ai_tbu","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-012-wudi:m022-0025","start":25,"end":27,"surface":"泰一","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"神祇、群體、匿名者或未定指代，保留來源，不補未見姓名與成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-012-wudi:m022-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"薄忌","kind":"person","person_id":"mqw_09p_4c8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-012-wudi:m022-0034","start":34,"end":36,"surface":"泰一","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"神祇、群體、匿名者或未定指代，保留來源，不補未見姓名與成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-012-wudi:m022-0042","start":42,"end":44,"surface":"五帝","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"神祇、群體、匿名者或未定指代，保留來源，不補未見姓名與成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-012-wudi:m022-0055","start":55,"end":57,"surface":"黃帝","kind":"person","person_id":"8jz_o3s_obt","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-012-wudi:m022-0066","start":66,"end":68,"surface":"泰一","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"神祇、群體、匿名者或未定指代，保留來源，不補未見姓名與成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-012-wudi:m022-0097","start":97,"end":99,"surface":"五帝","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"神祇、群體、匿名者或未定指代，保留來源，不補未見姓名與成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-012-wudi:m022-0120","start":120,"end":122,"surface":"北斗","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"神祇、群體、匿名者或未定指代，保留來源，不補未見姓名與成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-012-wudi:m022-0165","start":165,"end":167,"surface":"泰一","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"神祇、群體、匿名者或未定指代，保留來源，不補未見姓名與成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-012-wudi:m022-0175","start":175,"end":177,"surface":"五帝","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"神祇、群體、匿名者或未定指代，保留來源，不補未見姓名與成員。"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-012-wudi","book_id":"b-shiji-012","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-012-wudi"},{"id":"c-shiji-012-wudi:p023","text":"十一月辛已朔旦冬至，昧爽，天子始郊拜泰一。朝朝日，夕夕月，則揖；而見泰一如雍禮。其贊饗曰：「天始以寶鼎神筴授皇帝，朔而又朔，終而復始，皇帝敬拜見焉。」而衣上黃。其祠列火滿壇，壇旁烹炊具。有司云「祠上有光焉」。公卿言「皇帝始郊見泰一雲陽，有司奉瑄玉嘉牲薦饗。是夜有美光，及晝，黃氣上屬天。」太史公、祠官寬舒等曰：「神靈之休，祐福兆祥，宜因此地光域立泰畤壇以明應。令太祝領，（祀）［秋］及臘閒祠。三歲天子一郊見。」","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-012-wudi:m023-0013","start":13,"end":15,"surface":"天子","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-012-wudi:m023-0018","start":18,"end":20,"surface":"泰一","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"神祇、群體、匿名者或未定指代，保留來源，不補未見姓名與成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-012-wudi:m023-0034","start":34,"end":36,"surface":"泰一","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"神祇、群體、匿名者或未定指代，保留來源，不補未見姓名與成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-012-wudi:m023-0054","start":54,"end":56,"surface":"皇帝","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-012-wudi:m023-0067","start":67,"end":69,"surface":"皇帝","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-012-wudi:m023-0108","start":108,"end":110,"surface":"皇帝","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-012-wudi:m023-0113","start":113,"end":115,"surface":"泰一","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"神祇、群體、匿名者或未定指代，保留來源，不補未見姓名與成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-012-wudi:m023-0144","start":144,"end":147,"surface":"太史公","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"神祇、群體、匿名者或未定指代，保留來源，不補未見姓名與成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-012-wudi:m023-0150","start":150,"end":152,"surface":"寬舒","kind":"person","person_id":"j0a_7ai_tbu","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-012-wudi:m023-0181","start":181,"end":183,"surface":"太祝","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"神祇、群體、匿名者或未定指代，保留來源，不補未見姓名與成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-012-wudi:m023-0198","start":198,"end":200,"surface":"天子","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACAA","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-012-wudi","book_id":"b-shiji-012","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-012-wudi"},{"id":"c-shiji-012-wudi:p051","text":"今天子所興祠，泰一、后土，三年親郊祠，建漢家封禪，五年一修封。薄忌泰一及三一、冥羊、馬行、赤星，五，寬舒之祠官以歲時致禮。凡六祠，皆太祝領之。至如八神諸神，明年、凡山他名祠，行過則祀，去則已。方士所興祠，各自主，其人終則已，祠官弗主。他祠皆如其故。今上封禪，其後十二歲而還，徧於五嶽、四瀆矣。而方士之候祠神人，入海求蓬萊，終無有驗。而公孫卿之候神者，猶以大人跡為解，無其效。天子益怠厭方士之怪迂語矣，然終羈縻弗絕，冀遇其真。自此之後，方士言祠神者彌眾，然其效可睹矣。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-012-wudi:m051-0001","start":1,"end":3,"surface":"天子","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-012-wudi:m051-0007","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"泰一","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"神祇、群體、匿名者或未定指代，保留來源，不補未見姓名與成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-012-wudi:m051-0010","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"后土","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"神祇、群體、匿名者或未定指代，保留來源，不補未見姓名與成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-012-wudi:m051-0031","start":31,"end":33,"surface":"薄忌","kind":"person","person_id":"mqw_09p_4c8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-012-wudi:m051-0033","start":33,"end":35,"surface":"泰一","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"神祇、群體、匿名者或未定指代，保留來源，不補未見姓名與成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-012-wudi:m051-0036","start":36,"end":38,"surface":"三一","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"神祇、群體、匿名者或未定指代，保留來源，不補未見姓名與成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-012-wudi:m051-0039","start":39,"end":41,"surface":"冥羊","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"神祇、群體、匿名者或未定指代，保留來源，不補未見姓名與成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-012-wudi:m051-0042","start":42,"end":44,"surface":"馬行","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"神祇、群體、匿名者或未定指代，保留來源，不補未見姓名與成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-012-wudi:m051-0045","start":45,"end":47,"